{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EfvWszZesBANLDeJGopd6Z","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 (31.3% temporal instability) 和 Claim 3 (semi-synthetic\n2\t  framework) 是主要得分点。 Claim 2 meta-critique 被 1-2 个评审视为 \"obvious in hindsight\"，独立贡献权重下降。\n3\t  Claim 4 的 GSM1K 子发现 (N=33) 被 dismiss，plan_017 的 z-score 证据保留但 \"so what\" 回应不足。 Novelty\n4\t  受质疑（\"just MH-DIF at scale\"）但不构成 unanimous reject。IRT misspecification 被要求补充 sensitivity\n5\t  analysis（可能需要 multidimensional IRT pilot）。 整体：reviewer avg 5.0-5.5，acceptance probability\n6\t  ~30%，需要 2-3 major revisions。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n11\t  plan_id: plan_001\n12\t  description: 'METABENCH MMLU 全量 DIF 分析。temporal/ability/within-family 三种 cohort\n13\t    定义， 加 Li et al. proxy validation 和 domain specificity。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n18\t    temporal_n_c_items: 3918\n19\t    temporal_n_total: 12508\n20\t    temporal_fpr_on_li_clean: 0.318\n21\t    temporal_enrichment_ratio: 0.96\n22\t    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n23\t    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n24\t    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n25\t    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n26\t    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n27\t    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n28\t    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n29\t    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n30\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下这些数值本身站得住——31.3% 是 robust 的经验发现，random-split sanity\n31\t    (0.18%) 排除统计伪影， domain ρ=0.307 是 modest ecological correlation。问题不在数字，在解读： 1)\n32\t    enrichment≈1.0 证明 DIF 和 web-overlap labels 正交，但评审会问 \"if DIF doesn''t correlate\n33\t    with known contamination, what IS it detecting?\"——需要 plan_019 decomposition 才能回答\n34\t    \"item-specific instability, not capability gain\"。 2) within-family C%=61.3% (Llama-2\n35\t    vs 3) 远高于 cross-cohort 31.3%，评审会质疑 \"within-family analysis proves capability gain\n36\t    drives DIF, not contamination\"。 Median 档下 1 个评审接受 \"capability gain ≠ item instability\"\n37\t    论证，1 个不接受。 3) domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 在 median 档被视为 \"interesting but not definitive\"，\n38\t    不被攻击也不加分。\n39\t\n40\t    '\n41\t  tables:\n42\t  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary by ETS Classification'\n43\t    columns:\n44\t    - ets_class\n45\t    - n_items\n46\t    - pct\n47\t    - mean_abs_delta_mh\n48\t    rows:\n49\t    - - A (negligible)\n50\t      - 8590\n51\t      - 68.7\n52\t      - 0.43\n53\t    - - B (moderate)\n54\t      - 2641\n55\t      - 21.1\n56\t      - 1.24\n57\t    - - C (large)\n58\t      - 1277\n59\t      - 10.2\n60\t      - 2.31\n61\t    - - B+C (flagged)\n62\t      - 3918\n63\t      - 31.3\n64\t      - 1.58\n65\t  - name: 'Table 2: Cohort Definition Sensitivity'\n66\t    columns:\n67\t    - cohort\n68\t    - n_ref\n69\t    - n_foc\n70\t    - c_pct\n71\t    - enrichment\n72\t    rows:\n73\t    - - temporal (2023 vs 2024-H1)\n74\t      - 1253\n75\t      - 656\n76\t      - 31.3\n77\t      - 0.96\n78\t    - - ability (Q1 vs Q5)\n79\t      - ~1044\n80\t      - ~1044\n81\t      - 2.9\n82\t      - 1.19\n83\t    - - within-family (Llama-2 vs 3)\n84\t      - 161\n85\t      - 308\n86\t      - 61.3\n87\t      - —\n88\t    - - random split (sanity)\n89\t      - 950\n90\t      - 950\n91\t      - 0.18\n92\t      - —\n93\t  figures_description:\n94\t  - 'Fig 1: Histogram of |Δ_MH| across 12,508 items with ETS A/B/C thresholds marked.\n95\t    Long right tail (skewness ~1.8). 评审在 median 档认为 visualization 清晰。'\n96\t  - 'Fig 2: Domain specificity heatmap — 57 MMLU subjects × C% with ρ=0.307 annotation.\n97\t    Colorbar shows range 20.7-48.4%。评审会注意到 spread 大，但不会单独攻击。'\n98\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_001 是 paper 的基石。数据本身不受质疑，但 \"so what\" 需要后续实验 (plan_019,\n99\t    plan_017, plan_020) 支撑。评审预期反应： R1: \"Impressive scale, but what does 31% instability\n100\t    mean for practitioners?\" R2: \"The enrichment≈1.0 result is interesting but undermines\n101\t    the contamination framing\" R3: \"Within-family results suggest capability gain,\n102\t    not contamination\" 总体：plan_001 在 median 档得 strong accept 作为 empirical contribution，\n103\t    但单独不够——需要 downstream impact story。\n104\t\n105\t    '\n106\t- name: rl_robustness_validation\n107\t  plan_id: plan_002\n108\t  description: '验证 DIF 在 RL-trained 模型上的鲁棒性。SFT baseline vs alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)\n109\t    vs reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO)。关键在于 reasoning-RL 只有 10-15 个模型。\n110\t\n111\t    '\n112\t  expected_results:\n113\t    sft_cohort_n: 312\n114\t    alignment_rl_cohort_n: 477\n115\t    reasoning_rl_models_collected: 13\n116\t    sft_vs_alignment_jaccard_dif_flags: 0.72\n117\t    sft_temporal_c_pct: 30.8\n118\t    alignment_rl_temporal_c_pct: 32.1\n119\t    combined_with_reasoning_rl_c_pct: 31.5\n120\t    jaccard_base_vs_rl_augmented: 0.91\n121\t    tost_equivalence_p: 0.14\n122\t    tost_equivalence_bound: 0.05\n123\t    tost_verdict: inconclusive\n124\t    mink_auroc_sft: 0.61\n125\t    mink_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.58\n126\t    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.43\n127\t    constat_auroc_sft: 0.64\n128\t    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.39\n129\t    delong_p_mink_sft_vs_rl: 0.08\n130\t    delong_p_constat_sft_vs_rl: 0.03\n131\t    bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff_mink:\n132\t    - -0.02\n133\t    - 0.38\n134\t    bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff_constat:\n135\t    - 0.04\n136\t    - 0.46\n137\t    power_analysis_delta_boundary: 1.1\n138\t    power_analysis_tpr_at_boundary: 0.42\n139\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心问题：N=13 reasoning-RL 模型严重不足。 1) Group-level DIF flags\n140\t    在加入 13 个 RL 模型后变化很小 (Jaccard=0.91)，因为 N=13 在 N≈1900 focal cohort 中占比 <1%，统计上几乎无影响。评审会正确指出\n141\t    \"this doesn''t prove RL robustness, it proves RL models are too few to matter\"。\n142\t    2) TOST 等价性检验 p=0.14 不显著——无法证明等价，也无法证明差异。 Median 档评审判断：inconclusive，移至 limitations。\n143\t    3) 个体模型检测：ConStat 在 reasoning-RL 上 AUROC 降至 0.39 (显著下降)， 但 DIF 是 group-level 无法做个体比较，comparison\n144\t    不对等。 4) Power analysis 有理论价值：δ<1.1 时 TPR<0.42，清晰刻画了 detection boundary。 但评审会说\n145\t    \"you characterized a limitation, not solved it\"。 总体：plan_002 在 median 档被降级为 appendix，N=13\n146\t    是 fatal underpowering。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t  tables:\n150\t  - name: 'Table: DIF Flag Stability Under Cohort Composition Change'\n151\t    columns:\n152\t    - cohort_composition\n153\t    - n_total\n154\t    - c_pct\n155\t    - jaccard_vs_baseline\n156\t    rows:\n157\t    - - SFT only\n158\t      - 312\n159\t      - 30.8\n160\t      - —\n161\t    - - SFT + alignment-RL\n162\t      - 789\n163\t      - 32.1\n164\t      - 0.72\n165\t    - - SFT + alignment-RL + reasoning-RL\n166\t      - 802\n167\t      - 31.5\n168\t      - 0.91\n169\t  - name: 'Table: Individual Detector AUROC by Model Type'\n170\t    columns:\n171\t    - detector\n172\t    - sft\n173\t    - alignment_rl\n174\t    - reasoning_rl\n175\t    - delong_p\n176\t    rows:\n177\t    - - Min-K%\n178\t      - 0.61\n179\t      - 0.58\n180\t      - 0.43\n181\t      - 0.08\n182\t    - - ConStat\n183\t      - 0.64\n184\t      - 0.6\n185\t      - 0.39\n186\t      - 0.03\n187\t    - - DIF (group)\n188\t      - —\n189\t      - —\n190\t      - —\n191\t      - N/A\n192\t  figures_description:\n193\t  - 'Fig: Power curve — TPR vs δ for exploitation rate p ∈ {0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1.0}. 显示\n194\t    δ=1.1 是 practical detection boundary。曲线 shape 合理但评审会标注 ''simulation-derived, not\n195\t    empirically validated at these operating points''。'\n196\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_002 是最弱的实验。N=13 reasoning-RL 无法支撑任何统计结论。 TOST inconclusive\n197\t    意味着既不能声称 robust 也不能声称 fragile。 最佳策略：power analysis 图放 appendix，主文用一句话承认 \"reasoning-RL\n198\t    validation remains underpowered (N=13); alignment-RL cohort (N=477) shows stable\n199\t    DIF flags (Jaccard=0.72 vs SFT)\"。不把 RL robustness 作为 claim。\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n203\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n204\t  description: '独立评估 ConStat-style perturbation testing 在 MMLU 上的检测力。 200+ items paraphrased，comparison\n205\t    with DIF flags。\n206\t\n207\t    '\n208\t  expected_results:\n209\t    n_items_paraphrased: 217\n210\t    paraphrase_quality_human_eval: 0.78\n211\t    constat_detection_rate_fdr005: 0.23\n212\t    constat_detection_rate_fdr010: 0.31\n213\t    constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.08\n214\t    constat_fpr_on_clean_items: 0.06\n215\t    constat_effect_size_non_rl: 0.74\n216\t    constat_effect_size_rl: 0.31\n217\t    paraphrase_difficulty_shift_mean: 0.12\n218\t    paraphrase_difficulty_shift_std: 0.34\n219\t    n_models_tested: 15\n220\t    gpu_hours_used: 62\n221\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：ConStat 实验执行了但结果 mixed。 1) Paraphrase 质量 78% human-eval\n222\t    acceptable——约 22% 的 reformulation 引入了 subtle semantic shift，导致 difficulty 变化不纯粹来自\n223\t    contamination。 评审会质疑 paraphrase 质量是 confound。 2) FDR-controlled detection rate\n224\t    23% 在 non-RL 模型上——reasonable baseline 但 不 impressive。Jaccard=0.08 与 DIF 几乎无 overlap，说明两者\n225\t    detect 不同 signal。 3) RL 模型上 effect size 从 0.74 降至 0.31——方向正确但 N=15 模型下 CI 非常宽。\n226\t    4) 核心问题：ConStat 需要 inference access (running paraphrased items through models)，\n227\t    而 METABENCH 只有 original responses。所以 ConStat 只在 15 个有 inference access 的模型上跑，vs\n228\t    DIF 用全部 5,227 模型。Scale 不可比。 Median 档评审判断：\"useful baseline comparison but limited\n229\t    by small inference sample\"。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t  tables:\n233\t  - name: 'Table: ConStat Detection Summary'\n234\t    columns:\n235\t    - metric\n236\t    - non_rl_models\n237\t    - rl_models\n238\t    - all\n239\t    rows:\n240\t    - - n_models\n241\t      - 11\n242\t      - 4\n243\t      - 15\n244\t    - - detection_rate_fdr005\n245\t      - 0.27\n246\t      - 0.14\n247\t      - 0.23\n248\t    - - mean_effect_size\n249\t      - 0.74\n250\t      - 0.31\n251\t      - 0.61\n252\t    - - FPR\n253\t      - 0.05\n254\t      - 0.08\n255\t      - 0.06\n256\t  figures_description:\n257\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of ConStat score vs DIF |Δ_MH| for 217 items. 几乎无 correlation\n258\t    (r=0.06)，两个方法 orthogonal。评审可能认为这支持 ensemble 价值，也可能认为这说明两者 detect 不同 construct。'\n259\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_003a 提供了有价值的 baseline comparison，但不构成独立贡献。 ConStat-DIF\n260\t    orthogonality (Jaccard=0.08) 支持 meta-critique (不同方法 capture 不同 aspects)，但 N=15\n261\t    模型限制了结论强度。适合 appendix 作为 related work empirical comparison，不适合 main body。\n262\t\n263\t    '\n264\t- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n265\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n266\t  description: 'DVD generation variance 在 MMLU 上的独立评估。50 responses/item via temperature\n267\t    sampling。\n268\t\n269\t    '\n270\t  expected_results:\n271\t    n_models_tested: 12\n272\t    n_items_tested: 500\n273\t    responses_per_item: 50\n274\t    temperature: 0.8\n275\t    bimodal_detection_rate: 0.14\n276\t    bimodal_verbatim_contamination: 0.31\n277\t    bimodal_variant_contamination: 0.06\n278\t    dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.05\n279\t    dvd_fpr: 0.09\n280\t    variance_score_reliability: 0.62\n281\t    gpu_hours_used: 58\n282\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：DVD 结果较弱。 1) 只有 14% 的 items 显示 bimodal generation variance——远低于\n283\t    DIF 的 31.3%， 说明 generation variance 作为 contamination signal 灵敏度较低。 2) Verbatim\n284\t    contamination (31% bimodal) vs variant contamination (6% bimodal)： DVD 几乎只能 detect\n285\t    verbatim memorization，对 variant 无力。 3) 与 DIF 的 overlap 近乎为零 (Jaccard=0.05)，再次说明不同方法\n286\t    capture 不同 signal。 4) Variance score reliability 0.62——moderate at best。50 responses\n287\t    可能不足以 稳定估计 variance，但 GPU budget 已耗尽。 5) 核心限制：DVD 需要 open-weight + inference，排除\n288\t    closed-source models。 Median 档评审：\"limited detection power, primarily captures\n289\t    verbatim memorization which is already detectable by simpler methods (n-gram matching)\"。\n290\t\n291\t    '\n292\t  tables:\n293\t  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection by Contamination Type'\n294\t    columns:\n295\t    - contamination_type\n296\t    - n_items_tested\n297\t    - bimodal_rate\n298\t    - fpr\n299\t    rows:\n300\t    - - verbatim\n301\t      - 150\n302\t      - 0.31\n303\t      - 0.08\n304\t    - - variant\n305\t      - 150\n306\t      - 0.06\n307\t      - 0.1\n308\t    - - clean\n309\t      - 200\n310\t      - —\n311\t      - 0.09\n312\t  figures_description:\n313\t  - 'Fig: Violin plots of generation variance scores for bimodal (detected) vs unimodal\n314\t    items. Separation visible but overlap substantial。'\n315\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_003b 是最弱的独立实验。Detection power 低于 ConStat， 且需要 open-weight\n316\t    inference access。主要价值是证明 \"generation variance alone is insufficient\"——但这不是 surprising\n317\t    finding。Appendix material at best。 在 median 档的策略调整中，plan_003b 应被 deprioritized。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t- name: ensemble_fusion\n321\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n322\t  description: 'DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号 ensemble。依赖 003a 和 003b。\n323\t\n324\t    '\n325\t  expected_results:\n326\t    ensemble_auroc_2of3: 0.58\n327\t    ensemble_auroc_weighted: 0.62\n328\t    ensemble_fpr_2of3: 0.11\n329\t    ensemble_fpr_weighted: 0.09\n330\t    dif_standalone_auroc: 0.54\n331\t    constat_standalone_auroc: 0.51\n332\t    dvd_standalone_auroc: 0.47\n333\t    ensemble_improvement_over_best_single: 0.08\n334\t    cross_val_weight_stability: 0.43\n335\t    fpr_below_010_pct_configs: 0.45\n336\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：ensemble 无法达到预期目标。 1) FPR<0.10 只在 45% 的配置下成立——不满足 \"across\n337\t    all configurations\" 的目标。 Weighted fusion FPR=0.09 勉强达标，但 cross-val weight stability=0.43\n338\t    说明 weights 在 folds 之间不稳定，overfitting risk 高。 2) AUROC 提升 +0.08 over best single\n339\t    signal——marginal，且受限于 ground truth 的质量（Li et al. labels 作为 ground truth 本身是 plan\n340\t    质疑的对象）。 3) 根本矛盾：paper 的 Claim 2 论证 web-overlap labels 不适合评估 item-level detectors，然后用这些\n341\t    labels 训练 ensemble weights。评审会指出 circularity。 4) 003a/003b 的小样本 (N=12-15 models)\n342\t    使得 ensemble 的 training data 极有限。 Median 档评审：\"the ensemble adds complexity without\n343\t    resolving the fundamental ground truth problem the paper itself identifies\"。\n344\t\n345\t    '\n346\t  tables:\n347\t  - name: 'Table: Ensemble vs Individual Detectors'\n348\t    columns:\n349\t    - method\n350\t    - auroc\n351\t    - fpr\n352\t    - n_models_available\n353\t    rows:\n354\t    - - DIF (MH)\n355\t      - 0.54\n356\t      - 0.31\n357\t      - 5227\n358\t    - - ConStat\n359\t      - 0.51\n360\t      - 0.06\n361\t      - 15\n362\t    - - DVD\n363\t      - 0.47\n364\t      - 0.09\n365\t      - 12\n366\t    - - 2-of-3 majority\n367\t      - 0.58\n368\t      - 0.11\n369\t      - 12\n370\t    - - weighted fusion\n371\t      - 0.62\n372\t      - 0.09\n373\t      - 12\n374\t  figures_description:\n375\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves for individual detectors and ensemble. Ensemble curve marginally\n376\t    above individual curves, but 95% CI bands overlap substantially。'\n377\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_003c 被 drop 是正确决策。Ensemble 面临三重困难： (a) ground truth circularity,\n378\t    (b) small-N signal components, (c) marginal improvement。 Paper framing 已正确将 ensemble\n379\t    移至 \"future work\"。 在 rebuttal 中，如果评审问 \"why not ensemble?\"，回答是 \"ensemble requires\n380\t    validated ground truth, which our Claim 2 shows doesn''t exist; building the ground\n381\t    truth infrastructure (Claim 3) is prerequisite\"。\n382\t\n383\t    '\n384\t- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n385\t  plan_id: plan_004\n386\t  description: 'GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth。三步： temporal\n387\t    DIF → semi-synthetic → GSM1K correlation。\n388\t\n389\t    '\n390\t  expected_results:\n391\t    step1_gsm8k_n_items: 1319\n392\t    step1_n_ref: 1017\n393\t    step1_n_foc: 804\n394\t    step1_standard_c_pct: 18.9\n395\t    step1_external_c_pct: 47.4\n396\t    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n397\t    step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n398\t    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n399\t    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n400\t    step3_n_models: 33\n401\t    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n402\t    step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n403\t    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n404\t    step3_spearman_p: 0.02\n405\t    step3_partial_r: -0.385\n406\t    step3_partial_p: 0.027\n407\t    step3_bca_ci_pearson:\n408\t    - -0.714\n409\t    - -0.155\n410\t    step3_bca_ci_spearman:\n411\t    - -0.687\n412\t    - -0.031\n413\t    step3_permutation_p: 0.014\n414\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心动态：Step 1+2 稳固，Step 3 被 dismiss。 1) Step 1: GSM8K C%=18.9%\n415\t    (低于 MMLU 31.3%) 合理——GSM8K 是 math domain， temporal capability gain 更 uniform，所以\n416\t    differential 更少。评审接受。 2) Step 2: ΔTPR=+0.818 非常强——比 MMLU 的 +0.674 还好，因为 GSM8K\n417\t    是 single-domain，within-subject/cross-subject 区分不 applicable，matching 更干净。 Semi-synthetic\n418\t    framework portability 得到确认，Claim 3 加分。 3) Step 3: r=-0.478, p=0.005 但 N=33，BCa\n419\t    CI upper bound |r|=0.155。 Median 档下 1-2 个评审直接 dismiss： - \"N=33 with Spearman CI\n420\t    touching zero (−0.031) — underpowered\" - \"BCa CI [−0.714, −0.155] is too wide\n421\t    to be informative\" - \"contamination gap is itself a noisy proxy\" 方向正确 (negative\n422\t    correlation = DIF items resist contamination gains) 但 统计力不足以成为 independent evidence。\n423\t    4) 策略：median 档下 Step 3 从 Claim 4 子发现降级至 appendix \"suggestive evidence\"， Claim\n424\t    4 主要靠 plan_017 z-score + plan_020 circularity ablation。\n425\t\n426\t    '\n427\t  tables:\n428\t  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Temporal DIF Summary'\n429\t    columns:\n430\t    - matching\n431\t    - c_pct\n432\t    - sanity_c_pct\n433\t    - delta_tpr_p10\n434\t    rows:\n435\t    - - standard (total score)\n436\t      - 18.9\n437\t      - 0.3\n438\t      - 0.818\n439\t    - - external (MMLU score)\n440\t      - 47.4\n441\t      - —\n442\t      - 0.517\n443\t  - name: 'Table: GSM1K Correlation (Step 3) — Reviewer Critique Points'\n444\t    columns:\n445\t    - statistic\n446\t    - value\n447\t    - 95% CI\n448\t    - reviewer_concern\n449\t    rows:\n450\t    - - Pearson r\n451\t      - -0.478\n452\t      - '[-0.714, -0.155]'\n453\t      - CI wide\n454\t    - - Spearman ρ\n455\t      - -0.403\n456\t      - '[-0.687, -0.031]'\n457\t      - upper bound near zero\n458\t    - - Partial r\n459\t      - -0.385\n460\t      - '[-0.640, -0.058]'\n461\t      - controlling accuracy helps marginally\n462\t    - - N\n463\t      - 33\n464\t      - —\n465\t      - underpowered\n466\t  figures_description:\n467\t  - 'Fig: Scatter — GSM1K contamination gap (x) vs DIF-C item performance gap (y),\n468\t    N=33 models. Negative trend visible but scatter is large. Cook''s D 标注 Deepseek-math-7b-rl\n469\t    as influential point。评审在 median 档会聚焦 scatter 的 noise level。'\n470\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_004 是 mixed outcome。Step 1+2 加强 Claim 1+3 的 cross-benchmark\n471\t    generalizability故事，Step 3 是 liability。正确策略是： 主文用 Step 1+2 证明 \"DIF and semi-synthetic\n472\t    framework generalize to GSM8K\"， Step 3 降级至 appendix with explicit caveat \"suggestive\n473\t    evidence requiring replication with larger matched sample (N≥100)\"。\n474\t\n475\t    '\n476\t- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n477\t  plan_id: plan_005\n478\t  description: '在 MMLU 上拟合 bifactor IRT 模型 (general + 57 subject-specific factors)，\n479\t    选择 anchor items，执行 fixed-parameter calibration 的 equating pilot。\n480\t\n481\t    '\n482\t  expected_results:\n483\t    bifactor_convergence: true\n484\t    bifactor_iterations: 2847\n485\t    rmsea: 0.052\n486\t    cfi: 0.81\n487\t    tli: 0.78\n488\t    srmr: 0.068\n489\t    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.34\n490\t    subject_factors_variance_explained: 0.41\n491\t    residual_variance: 0.25\n492\t    n_anchor_items_selected: 1200\n493\t    anchor_selection_criterion: no DIF + discrimination > 0.5 + fit residual < 2.0\n494\t    equated_rho_vs_original: 0.94\n495\t    equated_rho_target: 0.95\n496\t    target_met: false\n497\t    computation_time_hours: 38\n498\t    memory_peak_gb: 127\n499\t  result_rationale: \"Median 档：bifactor 收敛但 fit 指标 mediocre。 1) RMSEA=0.052 在 acceptable\\\n500\t    \\ range (< 0.06) 但不 good (< 0.05)。 CFI=0.81 和 TLI=0.78 低于常规 threshold (0.90)——这是\\\n501\t    \\ 12,508 items × 5,227 models 的规模效应，absolute fit indices 在超大规模下系统偏低。 评审如果懂 psychometrics\\\n502\t    \\ 会接受，不懂会直接攻击 \\\"poor model fit\\\"。 2) General factor 只解释 34% variance——MMLU 的 57\\\n503\t    \\ subject 确实 highly multidimensional，这 validates \\\"1D IRT is misspecified\\\" 的论点。\\\n504\t    \\ 3) Equating ρ=0.94 未达 0.95 target——marginal miss。Plan_014 within-subject pre-check\\\n505\t    \\ (38.1% C%) 已经预示 DIF 在 bifactor 校正后不会大幅下降。 4) 计算成本高 (38 hours, 127GB RAM)——scalability\\\n506\t    \\ concern。 Median 档评审反应： - 支持者：\\\"bifactor results validate the multidimensionality\\\n507\t    \\ concern and motivate\\n  future work on MIRT-based DIF\\\"\\n- 反对者：\\\"CFI=0.81 means\\\n508\t    \\ the model doesn't fit, equating results are unreliable\\\" 总体：pilot 结果 suggestive\\\n509\t    \\ 但不 conclusive，适合 limitations/future work。\\n\"\n510\t  tables:\n511\t  - name: 'Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices'\n512\t    columns:\n513\t    - index\n514\t    - value\n515\t    - conventional_threshold\n516\t    - interpretation\n517\t    rows:\n518\t    - - RMSEA\n519\t      - 0.052\n520\t      - <0.06 acceptable\n521\t      - borderline acceptable\n522\t    - - CFI\n523\t      - 0.81\n524\t      - '>0.90 good'\n525\t      - below threshold\n526\t    - - TLI\n527\t      - 0.78\n528\t      - '>0.90 good'\n529\t      - below threshold\n530\t    - - SRMR\n531\t      - 0.068\n532\t      - <0.08 acceptable\n533\t      - acceptable\n534\t    - - general factor % variance\n535\t      - 34%\n536\t      - '>50% for unidimensional'\n537\t      - confirms multidimensionality\n538\t  figures_description:\n539\t  - 'Fig: Scree plot — first 10 eigenvalues. Sharp drop after factor 1 (eigenvalue=412)\n540\t    then gradual decline through factors 2-57. General factor dominant but not sufficient。'\n541\t  - 'Fig: Scatter — equated ranks vs original ranks. ρ=0.94, visible scatter especially\n542\t    in middle ranks (100-400 range)。'\n543\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_005 验证了 IRT misspecification 但未解决它。 34% general factor\n544\t    variance 是回应 \"IRT misspecification\" concern 的有力数据—— 证明 1D IRT 确实不足，但 DIF finding\n545\t    的方向和规模不受根本影响 (因为 bifactor 校正后 C% 从 31.3% 只降至 ~28-29%，仍然 substantial)。 关键洞察：评审要求的不是\n546\t    \"fix the misspecification\"，而是 \"show DIF findings are robust TO the misspecification\"。Plan_005\n547\t    可以回答这个——如果 bifactor 校正后 DIF 发现 qualitatively 不变，那就是 robustness evidence。 策略：不把\n548\t    equating 当 claim，而是作为 IRT sensitivity analysis 放 appendix。\n549\t\n550\t    '\n551\t- name: item_generation_calibration\n552\t  plan_id: plan_006\n553\t  description: '为 DIF-flagged items 生成替代题目，用 student simulation 校准难度。\n554\t\n555\t    '\n556\t  expected_results:\n557\t    n_items_generated: 150\n558\t    difficulty_correlation_prompt_based: 0.32\n559\t    difficulty_correlation_student_sim: 0.58\n560\t    difficulty_correlation_target: 0.75\n561\t    target_met: false\n562\t    cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.71\n563\t    subject_match_rate: 0.95\n564\t    human_quality_rating: 3.2\n565\t    human_quality_scale: 1-5\n566\t    holdout_panel_rho: 0.52\n567\t    gpu_hours_used: 145\n568\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：item generation 是 paper 最弱的环节之一。 1) Prompt-based difficulty\n569\t    targeting ρ=0.32 远低于文献报告的 0.45 upper bound—— MMLU 的 multiple-choice 格式和 domain\n570\t    diversity 使 prompt 控制困难。 2) Student simulation 提升到 ρ=0.58 (vs 文献 0.75-0.82 on\n571\t    simpler benchmarks)—— MMLU 的 57 domains 使 simulation calibration 更难泛化。 3) Cognitive\n572\t    level match rate 71%——约 29% 的 generated items 测量不同的 cognitive level，这是 construct\n573\t    validity threat。 4) Holdout panel ρ=0.52——远低于 equating 需要的精度。 Median 档评审会直接判定\n574\t    item generation 不成熟：\"generated items don''t match target difficulty well enough\n575\t    for equating; this is a negative result\"。 策略：plan_006 在 median 档是 negative result，移至\n576\t    appendix 作为 \"current limitations of LLM-based item generation for benchmark maintenance\"。\n577\t    不影响核心 claims。\n578\t\n579\t    '\n580\t  tables:\n581\t  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Difficulty Calibration'\n582\t    columns:\n583\t    - method\n584\t    - difficulty_ρ\n585\t    - n_items\n586\t    - notes\n587\t    rows:\n588\t    - - prompt-based targeting\n589\t      - 0.32\n590\t      - 150\n591\t      - below literature 0.10-0.45\n592\t    - - student simulation\n593\t      - 0.58\n594\t      - 150\n595\t      - below target 0.75\n596\t    - - combined (iterative)\n597\t      - 0.61\n598\t      - 80\n599\t      - 2-round refinement\n600\t  figures_description:\n601\t  - 'Fig: Scatter — target difficulty vs empirical difficulty for 150 generated items.\n602\t    Student simulation (blue) vs prompt-only (red). Visible improvement but still\n603\t    wide scatter band。'\n604\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_006 是 expected negative。Item generation 是 hard open problem，\n605\t    failure 不损害核心 paper 因为 regeneration 已从 claims 中 drop。 唯一价值：作为 future work 动机——\"automated\n606\t    benchmark maintenance requires better item generation, which remains an open problem\"。\n607\t\n608\t    '\n609\t- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n610\t  plan_id: plan_007\n611\t  description: '实现 Sinharay et al. (2006) 的 cumulative Bayesian DIF prior。 模拟 4 次\n612\t    successive benchmark administration，展示 evidence 累积带来的 power 提升。\n613\t\n614\t    '\n615\t  expected_results:\n616\t    simulation_n_administrations: 4\n617\t    admin_1_power_delta10: 0.41\n618\t    admin_2_power_delta10: 0.56\n619\t    admin_3_power_delta10: 0.68\n620\t    admin_4_power_delta10: 0.74\n621\t    target_admin3_power: 0.7\n622\t    target_met: false\n623\t    admin_3_power_delta14: 0.82\n624\t    fpr_cumulative: 0.048\n625\t    fpr_stable_across_admins: true\n626\t    bayes_factor_median_admin3: 4.2\n627\t    simulation_n_items: 500\n628\t    simulation_n_models_per_admin: 200\n629\t    computation_time_hours: 6\n630\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：simulation 结果方向正确但 target 未达。 1) 3 次 administration\n631\t    后 δ=1.0 的 power 从 0.41 升至 0.68——接近但未达 0.70 target。 δ=1.4 时 0.82 是可用的，说明 cumulative\n632\t    approach 有价值但主要对 medium effects。 2) FPR 控制良好 (0.048)，Bayesian prior 没有引入 FPR inflation。\n633\t    3) 核心限制：这是 pure simulation，没有 real data validation。 METABENCH 只有一个 \"administration\"（没有\n634\t    temporal sub-cohorts fine enough for 4 successive periods）。 4) Median 档评审：\"simulation-only\n635\t    result without empirical validation; interesting but speculative\"。 策略：appendix\n636\t    material。展示 concept 可行性但承认需要真实数据验证。 如果 ICLR 评审不熟悉 Bayesian DIF，这部分可能被完全忽略。\n637\t\n638\t    '\n639\t  tables:\n640\t  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Power by Administration'\n641\t    columns:\n642\t    - n_admins\n643\t    - power_delta_10\n644\t    - power_delta_14\n645\t    - power_delta_16\n646\t    - fpr\n647\t    rows:\n648\t    - - 1\n649\t      - 0.41\n650\t      - 0.68\n651\t      - 0.72\n652\t      - 0.042\n653\t    - - 2\n654\t      - 0.56\n655\t      - 0.77\n656\t      - 0.83\n657\t      - 0.045\n658\t    - - 3\n659\t      - 0.68\n660\t      - 0.82\n661\t      - 0.89\n662\t      - 0.048\n663\t    - - 4\n664\t      - 0.74\n665\t      - 0.86\n666\t      - 0.92\n667\t      - 0.047\n668\t  figures_description:\n669\t  - 'Fig: Power curves across administrations for δ ∈ {0.6, 0.8, 1.0, 1.2, 1.4, 1.6}.\n670\t    4 curves (one per admin count) showing cumulative improvement. Diminishing returns\n671\t    visible after admin 3。'\n672\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_007 有 modest value 作为 forward-looking contribution。 核心问题：ML\n673\t    评审对 \"future benchmark administrations\" 的 temporal framing 不熟悉——psychometrics 中\n674\t    repeated test administration 是常态， 但 LLM benchmarks 通常是 one-shot。需要明确解释 \"as new\n675\t    model generations emerge, the same benchmark is effectively re-administered\"。\n676\t    Appendix 放置，主文 limitations 中一句话提及 cumulative power improvement 可能性。\n677\t\n678\t    '\n679\t- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n680\t  plan_id: plan_008\n681\t  description: '分析 benchmark validity 在 progressive item replacement 下的退化模式。\n682\t\n683\t    '\n684\t  expected_results:\n685\t    replacement_5pct_rho: 0.998\n686\t    replacement_10pct_rho: 0.995\n687\t    replacement_20pct_rho: 0.987\n688\t    replacement_50pct_rho: 0.961\n689\t    reliability_5pct_alpha: 0.943\n690\t    reliability_10pct_alpha: 0.938\n691\t    reliability_20pct_alpha: 0.924\n692\t    reliability_50pct_alpha: 0.891\n693\t    original_alpha: 0.946\n694\t    construct_coverage_20pct_subjects_lost: 0\n695\t    construct_coverage_50pct_subjects_lost: 3\n696\t    validity_floor_replacement_pct: 0.35\n697\t    validity_floor_criterion: ρ > 0.98 AND α > 0.92\n698\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：graceful degradation 结果 clean 且 informative。 1) ρ 从\n699\t    0.998 (5%) 到 0.961 (50%) 的退化曲线非常 smooth——MMLU 的 12,508 items 有 massive redundancy，即使替换\n700\t    50% items 排名仍 strongly correlated。 这 complements plan_017 (ρ=0.997 after removing\n701\t    31% DIF items)。 2) Reliability (Cronbach''s α) 从 0.946 到 0.891——20% 是 practical\n702\t    threshold， 之后 reliability 下降加速。 3) Construct coverage：50% replacement 时 3 个 subjects\n703\t    可能 under-represented (small subjects with few items)。 4) 核心问题：replacement 假设 generated\n704\t    items 质量 OK——但 plan_006 显示 generation 质量不足。所以 \"graceful degradation\" 只在理论层面成立。\n705\t    Median 档评审：\"nice analysis but moot without better item generation (plan_006 failed)\"。\n706\t    策略：clean supplementary result，放 appendix。主文用 \"validity floor at ~35% replacement\"\n707\t    作为 practical recommendation。\n708\t\n709\t    '\n710\t  tables:\n711\t  - name: 'Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n712\t    columns:\n713\t    - replacement_pct\n714\t    - rank_ρ\n715\t    - cronbach_α\n716\t    - subjects_under_represented\n717\t    rows:\n718\t    - - 0\n719\t      - 1.0\n720\t      - 0.946\n721\t      - 0\n722\t    - - 5\n723\t      - 0.998\n724\t      - 0.943\n725\t      - 0\n726\t    - - 10\n727\t      - 0.995\n728\t      - 0.938\n729\t      - 0\n730\t    - - 20\n731\t      - 0.987\n732\t      - 0.924\n733\t      - 0\n734\t    - - 35\n735\t      - 0.974\n736\t      - 0.908\n737\t      - 1\n738\t    - - 50\n739\t      - 0.961\n740\t      - 0.891\n741\t      - 3\n742\t  figures_description:\n743\t  - 'Fig: Dual-axis line chart — rank ρ (left, blue) and Cronbach''s α (right, orange)\n744\t    vs replacement percentage. Both decline smoothly, α inflects around 25%。'\n745\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_008 的主要贡献是量化 \"how much replacement is safe\"—— 35% validity\n746\t    floor 直接对应 \"31% DIF items can be safely replaced without validity loss\"。这 strengthens\n747\t    the \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。 但 plan_006 的 negative result 使得 \"replacement\"\n748\t    变成 theoretical exercise。\n749\t\n750\t    '\n751\t- name: item_focused_trees\n752\t  plan_id: plan_009\n753\t  description: 'Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees 作为 categorical DIF 的替代方案。\n754\t    Treat model release date as continuous covariate。\n755\t\n756\t    '\n757\t  expected_results:\n758\t    n_items_analyzed: 12508\n759\t    n_items_with_significant_split: 4127\n760\t    pct_items_with_split: 33.0\n761\t    primary_split_date: '2023-11-15'\n762\t    concordance_with_mh_ets_c: 0.78\n763\t    additional_items_detected: 209\n764\t    items_missed_by_ift: 612\n765\t    jaccard_mh_vs_ift: 0.68\n766\t    computational_time_hours: 12\n767\t    n_items_nonlinear_trend: 1834\n768\t    pct_nonlinear: 14.7\n769\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：IFT 是有价值的 robustness check 但不改变 narrative。 1) 33% items\n770\t    with significant split vs MH 31.3%——high concordance (0.78)， 说明 categorical temporal\n771\t    split 不是 arbitrary 的。 2) Primary split date 2023-11-15——接近 GPT-4/Llama-2 到 Llama-3/Mixtral\n772\t    的代际转换点，有 face validity。 3) IFT detects 209 additional items that MH misses (mostly\n773\t    items with gradual drift rather than sharp shift)，同时 misses 612 items MH catches\n774\t    (mostly items where DIF is large but not monotone in date)。 4) 14.7% nonlinear\n775\t    trends——说明 some items 的 DIF 不是 monotone temporal， 暗示 \"contamination + capability\n776\t    gain + item drift\" 的 multi-factor story。 Median 档评审：\"useful supplementary analysis,\n777\t    confirms MH results are not artifacts of the cohort split\"。不改变 claims 但提供 methodological\n778\t    robustness。 策略：appendix 的 robustness check。主文一句话：\"IFT with continuous release\n779\t    date yields 78% concordance with MH categorical DIF (Appendix X)\"。\n780\t\n781\t    '\n782\t  tables:\n783\t  - name: 'Table: MH vs IFT Concordance'\n784\t    columns:\n785\t    - metric\n786\t    - mh_ets_c\n787\t    - ift_significant\n788\t    - overlap\n789\t    - jaccard\n790\t    rows:\n791\t    - - n_flagged\n792\t      - 3918\n793\t      - 4127\n794\t      - 3306\n795\t      - 0.68\n796\t    - - pct_flagged\n797\t      - 31.3\n798\t      - 33.0\n799\t      - 26.4\n800\t      - —\n801\t  figures_description:\n802\t  - 'Fig: Item DIF trajectory plots for 6 example items — IFT-detected smooth temporal\n803\t    trends vs MH binary classification. Shows items where IFT captures gradual drift\n804\t    that MH misses (top row) and items where MH captures sharp shift that IFT underweights\n805\t    (bottom row)。'\n806\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_009 的 concordance=0.78 有两面性： - 支持：MH 的 categorical split\n807\t    不是 artifact，IFT confirms temporal instability - 质疑：22% discordance 说明 method choice\n808\t    matters，results are partially method-dependent 评审在 median 档接受 IFT 作为 robustness\n809\t    check，不会深入追究 discordance。\n810\t\n811\t    '\n812\t- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n813\t  plan_id: plan_010\n814\t  description: '在 decoder-only 子群内重跑 DIF，检验 architecture heterogeneity 是否影响 IRT fit。\n815\t\n816\t    '\n817\t  expected_results:\n818\t    n_decoder_only: 5226\n819\t    n_non_decoder: 1\n820\t    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n821\t    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n822\t    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n823\t    jaccard_decoder_vs_full: 1.0\n824\t    irt_rmsea_full: 0.089\n825\t    irt_rmsea_decoder_only: 0.088\n826\t    irt_cfi_full: 0.72\n827\t    irt_cfi_decoder_only: 0.72\n828\t    irt_fit_improvement: negligible\n829\t    pct_models_lz_gt2: 98.0\n830\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档：plan_010 是 clean knockout result。 1) METABENCH MMLU\n831\t    是 99.98% decoder-only (5226/5227)——removing 1 non-decoder model changes literally\n832\t    nothing (Jaccard=1.0)。 2) IRT fit 不改善 (RMSEA 0.089→0.088, CFI 0.72→0.72)——因为 misfit\n833\t    来自 MMLU 的 57-subject multidimensionality，不是 architecture heterogeneity。 3) 98%\n834\t    models 有 |Lz|>2——这反映 1D IRT 对 MMLU 的 fundamental misspecification， 不是 population\n835\t    heterogeneity。 Median 档评审接受这个 null result：architecture 不是问题。但会转向 \"OK so the misfit\n836\t    is from multidimensionality, have you tried multidimensional IRT?\"—— 这是 median\n837\t    档的核心 concern 之一。 策略：主文用一段报告 99.98% decoder-only + Jaccard=1.0。 IRT fit 数据放 limitations\n838\t    讨论，作为 multidimensional IRT future work 的动机。\n839\t\n840\t    '\n841\t  tables:\n842\t  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification Results'\n843\t    columns:\n844\t    - population\n845\t    - n_models\n846\t    - c_pct\n847\t    - rmsea\n848\t    - cfi\n849\t    - pct_lz_gt2\n850\t    rows:\n851\t    - - full\n852\t      - 5227\n853\t      - 31.3\n854\t      - 0.089\n855\t      - 0.72\n856\t      - 98.0\n857\t    - - decoder-only\n858\t      - 5226\n859\t      - 31.3\n860\t      - 0.088\n861\t      - 0.72\n862\t      - 98.0\n863\t    - - delta\n864\t      - —\n865\t      - 0.0\n866\t      - 0.001\n867\t      - 0.0\n868\t      - 0.0\n869\t  figures_description:\n870\t  - 'Fig: (Not needed — result is trivially null due to 99.98% decoder-only composition.\n871\t    A one-line footnote suffices.)'\n872\t  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_010 的 value 是 defensive：排除一个 potential confound。 但它也暴露了真正的问题——IRT\n873\t    misfit 来自 multidimensionality， 这正是评审的 attack vector。Plan_005 bifactor pilot 是\n874\t    partial response， 但 median 档下不够 convincing (CFI=0.81)。 最佳回应策略：承认 misspecification，展示\n875\t    DIF 发现在 bifactor 校正后 qualitatively 不变 (C% ~28-29% vs 31.3%)，argue \"our findings\n876\t    are conservative estimates\"。\n877\t\n878\t    '\n879\t- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n880\t  plan_id: plan_011\n881\t  description: '向真实 METABENCH response matrix 注入已知 contamination，测量 DIF 检测力。\n882\t\n883\t    '\n884\t  expected_results:\n885\t    n_clean_items: 500\n886\t    n_injected_items: 200\n887\t    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n888\t    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n889\t    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n890\t    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n891\t    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n892\t    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n893\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n894\t    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n895\t    ability_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n896\t    cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.0\n897\t    within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.186\n898\t    dose_response_monotone: true\n899\t    dose_response_p_values:\n900\t    - 0.3\n901\t    - 0.5\n902\t    - 0.7\n903\t    - 1.0\n904\t  result_rationale: \"Median 档：plan_011 是 paper 的 strongest evidence 之一。 1) ΔTPR=+0.508\\\n905\t    \\ at p=0.5 是 clean, large effect——从 baseline 0.326 升至 0.834， 明确证明 DIF 能 detect\\\n906\t    \\ injected differential contamination。 2) Dose-response 从 p=0.3 到 p=1.0 monotone——mechanistic\\\n907\t    \\ validation。 3) Cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000 是 key innovation——完全消除 FPR\\\n908\t    \\ inflation， vs within-subject matching +0.186。这是 Claim 3 的核心证据。 4) Baseline FPR=0.314\\\n909\t    \\ (= temporal C%=31.3%)——评审会问 \\\"is 31% baseline FPR acceptable?\\\" Answer: this\\\n910\t    \\ IS the real DIF rate, not false positives. Semi-synthetic 只 adds signal on top\\\n911\t    \\ of real baseline。 Median 档评审对 plan_011 的质疑集中在： - \\\"injection mechanism (incorrect→correct)\\\n912\t    \\ is simplistic—real contamination\\n  may produce different patterns (e.g., faster\\\n913\t    \\ response time, different error types)\\\"\\n- \\\"you inject into real matrices,\\\n914\t    \\ but the contamination is still artificial\\\" 这些是 acknowledged limitations，不是\\\n915\t    \\ fatal flaws。 策略：plan_011 在主文 §4 占重要位置。Cross-subject matching 作为 methodological\\\n916\t    \\ recommendation 明确 highlight。\\n\"\n917\t  tables:\n918\t  - name: 'Table: Semi-synthetic Detection Power (Cross-subject Matching)'\n919\t    columns:\n920\t    - exploitation_rate_p\n921\t    - baseline_tpr\n922\t    - injected_tpr\n923\t    - delta_tpr\n924\t    - fpr\n925\t    - delta_fpr\n926\t    rows:\n927\t    - - 0.0 (no injection)\n928\t      - 0.326\n929\t      - 0.326\n930\t      - 0.0\n931\t      - 0.314\n932\t      - 0.0\n933\t    - - 0.3\n934\t      - 0.326\n935\t      - 0.548\n936\t      - 0.222\n937\t      - 0.314\n938\t      - 0.0\n939\t    - - 0.5\n940\t      - 0.326\n941\t      - 0.834\n942\t      - 0.508\n943\t      - 0.314\n944\t      - 0.0\n945\t    - - 0.7\n946\t      - 0.326\n947\t      - 0.99\n948\t      - 0.664\n949\t      - 0.314\n950\t      - 0.0\n951\t    - - 1.0\n952\t      - 0.326\n953\t      - 1.0\n954\t      - 0.674\n955\t      - 0.314\n956\t      - 0.0\n957\t  - name: 'Table: Within-subject vs Cross-subject Matching'\n958\t    columns:\n959\t    - matching\n960\t    - delta_tpr_p05\n961\t    - delta_fpr_p10\n962\t    - fpr_stable\n963\t    rows:\n964\t    - - within-subject\n965\t      - 0.457\n966\t      - 0.186\n967\t      - false\n968\t    - - cross-subject\n969\t      - 0.508\n970\t      - 0.0\n971\t      - true\n972\t  figures_description:\n973\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve — ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p. Cross-subject matching\n974\t    (blue, solid) vs within-subject (red, dashed). Cross-subject 在 ΔTPR 上 comparable\n975\t    or superior，同时 ΔFPR=0。Clean separation。这是 paper 最有说服力的 figure 之一。'\n976\t  - 'Fig: FPR control comparison — barplot showing FPR at p=0, 0.5, 1.0 for within-subject\n977\t    vs cross-subject matching. Within-subject FPR inflates from 0.31 to 0.50; cross-subject\n978\t    stays flat at 0.31。'\n979\t  analysis: Median 档下 plan_011 (+plan_016 cross-subject replication) 是 Claim 3 的 robust\n980\t    foundation。Reviewers 在 median 档给 semi-synthetic framework positive marks (novelty\n981\t    sub-score 2.5 on this specific contribution)。 唯一 downside：injection simplicity。Rebuttal\n982\t    准备： \"Our injection flips incorrect→correct, which is the minimal model of contamination\n983\t    (memorized answer). More complex patterns (partial memorization, verbatim recall)\n984\t    would produce LARGER DIF effects, not smaller—our power estimates are conservative.\"\n985\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17abd94c-441a-4590-97d9-9458f106f7c0","uuid":"493fc5bb-381b-4cc6-a774-f58a0b715754","timestamp":"2026-05-21T07:00:33.044Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T062008/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 (31.3% temporal instability) 和 Claim 3 (semi-synthetic\n  framework) 是主要得分点。 Claim 2 meta-critique 被 1-2 个评审视为 \"obvious in hindsight\"，独立贡献权重下降。\n  Claim 4 的 GSM1K 子发现 (N=33) 被 dismiss，plan_017 的 z-score 证据保留但 \"so what\" 回应不足。 Novelty\n  受质疑（\"just MH-DIF at scale\"）但不构成 unanimous reject。IRT misspecification 被要求补充 sensitivity\n  analysis（可能需要 multidimensional IRT pilot）。 整体：reviewer avg 5.0-5.5，acceptance probability\n  ~30%，需要 2-3 major revisions。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: real_data_dif_mmlu\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 'METABENCH MMLU 全量 DIF 分析。temporal/ability/within-family 三种 cohort\n    定义， 加 Li et al. proxy validation 和 domain specificity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_ets_c_pct: 31.3\n    temporal_n_c_items: 3918\n    temporal_n_total: 12508\n    temporal_fpr_on_li_clean: 0.318\n    temporal_enrichment_ratio: 0.96\n    ability_ets_c_pct: 2.9\n    ability_enrichment: 1.19\n    within_family_llama2v3_c_pct: 61.3\n    within_family_mistral_mixtral_c_pct: 38.7\n    domain_spearman_rho: 0.307\n    domain_spearman_p: 0.02\n    sanity_random_split_c_pct: 0.18\n    temporal_ability_jaccard: 0.014\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下这些数值本身站得住——31.3% 是 robust 的经验发现，random-split sanity\n    (0.18%) 排除统计伪影， domain ρ=0.307 是 modest ecological correlation。问题不在数字，在解读： 1)\n    enrichment≈1.0 证明 DIF 和 web-overlap labels 正交，但评审会问 \"if DIF doesn''t correlate\n    with known contamination, what IS it detecting?\"——需要 plan_019 decomposition 才能回答\n    \"item-specific instability, not capability gain\"。 2) within-family C%=61.3% (Llama-2\n    vs 3) 远高于 cross-cohort 31.3%，评审会质疑 \"within-family analysis proves capability gain\n    drives DIF, not contamination\"。 Median 档下 1 个评审接受 \"capability gain ≠ item instability\"\n    论证，1 个不接受。 3) domain ρ=0.307 (p=0.02) 在 median 档被视为 \"interesting but not definitive\"，\n    不被攻击也不加分。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Temporal DIF Summary by ETS Classification'\n    columns:\n    - ets_class\n    - n_items\n    - pct\n    - mean_abs_delta_mh\n    rows:\n    - - A (negligible)\n      - 8590\n      - 68.7\n      - 0.43\n    - - B (moderate)\n      - 2641\n      - 21.1\n      - 1.24\n    - - C (large)\n      - 1277\n      - 10.2\n      - 2.31\n    - - B+C (flagged)\n      - 3918\n      - 31.3\n      - 1.58\n  - name: 'Table 2: Cohort Definition Sensitivity'\n    columns:\n    - cohort\n    - n_ref\n    - n_foc\n    - c_pct\n    - enrichment\n    rows:\n    - - temporal (2023 vs 2024-H1)\n      - 1253\n      - 656\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.96\n    - - ability (Q1 vs Q5)\n      - ~1044\n      - ~1044\n      - 2.9\n      - 1.19\n    - - within-family (Llama-2 vs 3)\n      - 161\n      - 308\n      - 61.3\n      - —\n    - - random split (sanity)\n      - 950\n      - 950\n      - 0.18\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: Histogram of |Δ_MH| across 12,508 items with ETS A/B/C thresholds marked.\n    Long right tail (skewness ~1.8). 评审在 median 档认为 visualization 清晰。'\n  - 'Fig 2: Domain specificity heatmap — 57 MMLU subjects × C% with ρ=0.307 annotation.\n    Colorbar shows range 20.7-48.4%。评审会注意到 spread 大，但不会单独攻击。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_001 是 paper 的基石。数据本身不受质疑，但 \"so what\" 需要后续实验 (plan_019,\n    plan_017, plan_020) 支撑。评审预期反应： R1: \"Impressive scale, but what does 31% instability\n    mean for practitioners?\" R2: \"The enrichment≈1.0 result is interesting but undermines\n    the contamination framing\" R3: \"Within-family results suggest capability gain,\n    not contamination\" 总体：plan_001 在 median 档得 strong accept 作为 empirical contribution，\n    但单独不够——需要 downstream impact story。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_robustness_validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '验证 DIF 在 RL-trained 模型上的鲁棒性。SFT baseline vs alignment-RL (DPO/ORPO)\n    vs reasoning-RL (GRPO/PPO)。关键在于 reasoning-RL 只有 10-15 个模型。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_cohort_n: 312\n    alignment_rl_cohort_n: 477\n    reasoning_rl_models_collected: 13\n    sft_vs_alignment_jaccard_dif_flags: 0.72\n    sft_temporal_c_pct: 30.8\n    alignment_rl_temporal_c_pct: 32.1\n    combined_with_reasoning_rl_c_pct: 31.5\n    jaccard_base_vs_rl_augmented: 0.91\n    tost_equivalence_p: 0.14\n    tost_equivalence_bound: 0.05\n    tost_verdict: inconclusive\n    mink_auroc_sft: 0.61\n    mink_auroc_alignment_rl: 0.58\n    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.43\n    constat_auroc_sft: 0.64\n    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.39\n    delong_p_mink_sft_vs_rl: 0.08\n    delong_p_constat_sft_vs_rl: 0.03\n    bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff_mink:\n    - -0.02\n    - 0.38\n    bootstrap_ci_auroc_diff_constat:\n    - 0.04\n    - 0.46\n    power_analysis_delta_boundary: 1.1\n    power_analysis_tpr_at_boundary: 0.42\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心问题：N=13 reasoning-RL 模型严重不足。 1) Group-level DIF flags\n    在加入 13 个 RL 模型后变化很小 (Jaccard=0.91)，因为 N=13 在 N≈1900 focal cohort 中占比 <1%，统计上几乎无影响。评审会正确指出\n    \"this doesn''t prove RL robustness, it proves RL models are too few to matter\"。\n    2) TOST 等价性检验 p=0.14 不显著——无法证明等价，也无法证明差异。 Median 档评审判断：inconclusive，移至 limitations。\n    3) 个体模型检测：ConStat 在 reasoning-RL 上 AUROC 降至 0.39 (显著下降)， 但 DIF 是 group-level 无法做个体比较，comparison\n    不对等。 4) Power analysis 有理论价值：δ<1.1 时 TPR<0.42，清晰刻画了 detection boundary。 但评审会说\n    \"you characterized a limitation, not solved it\"。 总体：plan_002 在 median 档被降级为 appendix，N=13\n    是 fatal underpowering。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DIF Flag Stability Under Cohort Composition Change'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_composition\n    - n_total\n    - c_pct\n    - jaccard_vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - SFT only\n      - 312\n      - 30.8\n      - —\n    - - SFT + alignment-RL\n      - 789\n      - 32.1\n      - 0.72\n    - - SFT + alignment-RL + reasoning-RL\n      - 802\n      - 31.5\n      - 0.91\n  - name: 'Table: Individual Detector AUROC by Model Type'\n    columns:\n    - detector\n    - sft\n    - alignment_rl\n    - reasoning_rl\n    - delong_p\n    rows:\n    - - Min-K%\n      - 0.61\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.43\n      - 0.08\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.03\n    - - DIF (group)\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - N/A\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power curve — TPR vs δ for exploitation rate p ∈ {0.4, 0.6, 0.8, 1.0}. 显示\n    δ=1.1 是 practical detection boundary。曲线 shape 合理但评审会标注 ''simulation-derived, not\n    empirically validated at these operating points''。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_002 是最弱的实验。N=13 reasoning-RL 无法支撑任何统计结论。 TOST inconclusive\n    意味着既不能声称 robust 也不能声称 fragile。 最佳策略：power analysis 图放 appendix，主文用一句话承认 \"reasoning-RL\n    validation remains underpowered (N=13); alignment-RL cohort (N=477) shows stable\n    DIF flags (Jaccard=0.72 vs SFT)\"。不把 RL robustness 作为 claim。\n\n    '\n- name: constat_perturbation_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: '独立评估 ConStat-style perturbation testing 在 MMLU 上的检测力。 200+ items paraphrased，comparison\n    with DIF flags。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_paraphrased: 217\n    paraphrase_quality_human_eval: 0.78\n    constat_detection_rate_fdr005: 0.23\n    constat_detection_rate_fdr010: 0.31\n    constat_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.08\n    constat_fpr_on_clean_items: 0.06\n    constat_effect_size_non_rl: 0.74\n    constat_effect_size_rl: 0.31\n    paraphrase_difficulty_shift_mean: 0.12\n    paraphrase_difficulty_shift_std: 0.34\n    n_models_tested: 15\n    gpu_hours_used: 62\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：ConStat 实验执行了但结果 mixed。 1) Paraphrase 质量 78% human-eval\n    acceptable——约 22% 的 reformulation 引入了 subtle semantic shift，导致 difficulty 变化不纯粹来自\n    contamination。 评审会质疑 paraphrase 质量是 confound。 2) FDR-controlled detection rate\n    23% 在 non-RL 模型上——reasonable baseline 但 不 impressive。Jaccard=0.08 与 DIF 几乎无 overlap，说明两者\n    detect 不同 signal。 3) RL 模型上 effect size 从 0.74 降至 0.31——方向正确但 N=15 模型下 CI 非常宽。\n    4) 核心问题：ConStat 需要 inference access (running paraphrased items through models)，\n    而 METABENCH 只有 original responses。所以 ConStat 只在 15 个有 inference access 的模型上跑，vs\n    DIF 用全部 5,227 模型。Scale 不可比。 Median 档评审判断：\"useful baseline comparison but limited\n    by small inference sample\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: ConStat Detection Summary'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - non_rl_models\n    - rl_models\n    - all\n    rows:\n    - - n_models\n      - 11\n      - 4\n      - 15\n    - - detection_rate_fdr005\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.23\n    - - mean_effect_size\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.61\n    - - FPR\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.06\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot of ConStat score vs DIF |Δ_MH| for 217 items. 几乎无 correlation\n    (r=0.06)，两个方法 orthogonal。评审可能认为这支持 ensemble 价值，也可能认为这说明两者 detect 不同 construct。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_003a 提供了有价值的 baseline comparison，但不构成独立贡献。 ConStat-DIF\n    orthogonality (Jaccard=0.08) 支持 meta-critique (不同方法 capture 不同 aspects)，但 N=15\n    模型限制了结论强度。适合 appendix 作为 related work empirical comparison，不适合 main body。\n\n    '\n- name: dvd_generation_variance_eval\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: 'DVD generation variance 在 MMLU 上的独立评估。50 responses/item via temperature\n    sampling。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_tested: 12\n    n_items_tested: 500\n    responses_per_item: 50\n    temperature: 0.8\n    bimodal_detection_rate: 0.14\n    bimodal_verbatim_contamination: 0.31\n    bimodal_variant_contamination: 0.06\n    dvd_dif_overlap_jaccard: 0.05\n    dvd_fpr: 0.09\n    variance_score_reliability: 0.62\n    gpu_hours_used: 58\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：DVD 结果较弱。 1) 只有 14% 的 items 显示 bimodal generation variance——远低于\n    DIF 的 31.3%， 说明 generation variance 作为 contamination signal 灵敏度较低。 2) Verbatim\n    contamination (31% bimodal) vs variant contamination (6% bimodal)： DVD 几乎只能 detect\n    verbatim memorization，对 variant 无力。 3) 与 DIF 的 overlap 近乎为零 (Jaccard=0.05)，再次说明不同方法\n    capture 不同 signal。 4) Variance score reliability 0.62——moderate at best。50 responses\n    可能不足以 稳定估计 variance，但 GPU budget 已耗尽。 5) 核心限制：DVD 需要 open-weight + inference，排除\n    closed-source models。 Median 档评审：\"limited detection power, primarily captures\n    verbatim memorization which is already detectable by simpler methods (n-gram matching)\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: DVD Detection by Contamination Type'\n    columns:\n    - contamination_type\n    - n_items_tested\n    - bimodal_rate\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - verbatim\n      - 150\n      - 0.31\n      - 0.08\n    - - variant\n      - 150\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.1\n    - - clean\n      - 200\n      - —\n      - 0.09\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Violin plots of generation variance scores for bimodal (detected) vs unimodal\n    items. Separation visible but overlap substantial。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_003b 是最弱的独立实验。Detection power 低于 ConStat， 且需要 open-weight\n    inference access。主要价值是证明 \"generation variance alone is insufficient\"——但这不是 surprising\n    finding。Appendix material at best。 在 median 档的策略调整中，plan_003b 应被 deprioritized。\n\n    '\n- name: ensemble_fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: 'DIF + ConStat + DVD 三信号 ensemble。依赖 003a 和 003b。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_auroc_2of3: 0.58\n    ensemble_auroc_weighted: 0.62\n    ensemble_fpr_2of3: 0.11\n    ensemble_fpr_weighted: 0.09\n    dif_standalone_auroc: 0.54\n    constat_standalone_auroc: 0.51\n    dvd_standalone_auroc: 0.47\n    ensemble_improvement_over_best_single: 0.08\n    cross_val_weight_stability: 0.43\n    fpr_below_010_pct_configs: 0.45\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：ensemble 无法达到预期目标。 1) FPR<0.10 只在 45% 的配置下成立——不满足 \"across\n    all configurations\" 的目标。 Weighted fusion FPR=0.09 勉强达标，但 cross-val weight stability=0.43\n    说明 weights 在 folds 之间不稳定，overfitting risk 高。 2) AUROC 提升 +0.08 over best single\n    signal——marginal，且受限于 ground truth 的质量（Li et al. labels 作为 ground truth 本身是 plan\n    质疑的对象）。 3) 根本矛盾：paper 的 Claim 2 论证 web-overlap labels 不适合评估 item-level detectors，然后用这些\n    labels 训练 ensemble weights。评审会指出 circularity。 4) 003a/003b 的小样本 (N=12-15 models)\n    使得 ensemble 的 training data 极有限。 Median 档评审：\"the ensemble adds complexity without\n    resolving the fundamental ground truth problem the paper itself identifies\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Ensemble vs Individual Detectors'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - auroc\n    - fpr\n    - n_models_available\n    rows:\n    - - DIF (MH)\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.31\n      - 5227\n    - - ConStat\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.06\n      - 15\n    - - DVD\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.09\n      - 12\n    - - 2-of-3 majority\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.11\n      - 12\n    - - weighted fusion\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.09\n      - 12\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves for individual detectors and ensemble. Ensemble curve marginally\n    above individual curves, but 95% CI bands overlap substantially。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_003c 被 drop 是正确决策。Ensemble 面临三重困难： (a) ground truth circularity,\n    (b) small-N signal components, (c) marginal improvement。 Paper framing 已正确将 ensemble\n    移至 \"future work\"。 在 rebuttal 中，如果评审问 \"why not ensemble?\"，回答是 \"ensemble requires\n    validated ground truth, which our Claim 2 shows doesn''t exist; building the ground\n    truth infrastructure (Claim 3) is prerequisite\"。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_benchmark_gsm8k\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'GSM8K 上复制 DIF 分析，GSM1K 作为 contamination ground truth。三步： temporal\n    DIF → semi-synthetic → GSM1K correlation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    step1_gsm8k_n_items: 1319\n    step1_n_ref: 1017\n    step1_n_foc: 804\n    step1_standard_c_pct: 18.9\n    step1_external_c_pct: 47.4\n    step1_sanity_c_pct: 0.3\n    step1_standard_external_spearman: 0.926\n    step2_standard_delta_tpr_p10: 0.818\n    step2_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.517\n    step3_n_models: 33\n    step3_pearson_r: -0.478\n    step3_pearson_p: 0.005\n    step3_spearman_rho: -0.403\n    step3_spearman_p: 0.02\n    step3_partial_r: -0.385\n    step3_partial_p: 0.027\n    step3_bca_ci_pearson:\n    - -0.714\n    - -0.155\n    step3_bca_ci_spearman:\n    - -0.687\n    - -0.031\n    step3_permutation_p: 0.014\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心动态：Step 1+2 稳固，Step 3 被 dismiss。 1) Step 1: GSM8K C%=18.9%\n    (低于 MMLU 31.3%) 合理——GSM8K 是 math domain， temporal capability gain 更 uniform，所以\n    differential 更少。评审接受。 2) Step 2: ΔTPR=+0.818 非常强——比 MMLU 的 +0.674 还好，因为 GSM8K\n    是 single-domain，within-subject/cross-subject 区分不 applicable，matching 更干净。 Semi-synthetic\n    framework portability 得到确认，Claim 3 加分。 3) Step 3: r=-0.478, p=0.005 但 N=33，BCa\n    CI upper bound |r|=0.155。 Median 档下 1-2 个评审直接 dismiss： - \"N=33 with Spearman CI\n    touching zero (−0.031) — underpowered\" - \"BCa CI [−0.714, −0.155] is too wide\n    to be informative\" - \"contamination gap is itself a noisy proxy\" 方向正确 (negative\n    correlation = DIF items resist contamination gains) 但 统计力不足以成为 independent evidence。\n    4) 策略：median 档下 Step 3 从 Claim 4 子发现降级至 appendix \"suggestive evidence\"， Claim\n    4 主要靠 plan_017 z-score + plan_020 circularity ablation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: GSM8K Temporal DIF Summary'\n    columns:\n    - matching\n    - c_pct\n    - sanity_c_pct\n    - delta_tpr_p10\n    rows:\n    - - standard (total score)\n      - 18.9\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.818\n    - - external (MMLU score)\n      - 47.4\n      - —\n      - 0.517\n  - name: 'Table: GSM1K Correlation (Step 3) — Reviewer Critique Points'\n    columns:\n    - statistic\n    - value\n    - 95% CI\n    - reviewer_concern\n    rows:\n    - - Pearson r\n      - -0.478\n      - '[-0.714, -0.155]'\n      - CI wide\n    - - Spearman ρ\n      - -0.403\n      - '[-0.687, -0.031]'\n      - upper bound near zero\n    - - Partial r\n      - -0.385\n      - '[-0.640, -0.058]'\n      - controlling accuracy helps marginally\n    - - N\n      - 33\n      - —\n      - underpowered\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter — GSM1K contamination gap (x) vs DIF-C item performance gap (y),\n    N=33 models. Negative trend visible but scatter is large. Cook''s D 标注 Deepseek-math-7b-rl\n    as influential point。评审在 median 档会聚焦 scatter 的 noise level。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_004 是 mixed outcome。Step 1+2 加强 Claim 1+3 的 cross-benchmark\n    generalizability故事，Step 3 是 liability。正确策略是： 主文用 Step 1+2 证明 \"DIF and semi-synthetic\n    framework generalize to GSM8K\"， Step 3 降级至 appendix with explicit caveat \"suggestive\n    evidence requiring replication with larger matched sample (N≥100)\"。\n\n    '\n- name: bifactor_irt_equating_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在 MMLU 上拟合 bifactor IRT 模型 (general + 57 subject-specific factors)，\n    选择 anchor items，执行 fixed-parameter calibration 的 equating pilot。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bifactor_convergence: true\n    bifactor_iterations: 2847\n    rmsea: 0.052\n    cfi: 0.81\n    tli: 0.78\n    srmr: 0.068\n    general_factor_variance_explained: 0.34\n    subject_factors_variance_explained: 0.41\n    residual_variance: 0.25\n    n_anchor_items_selected: 1200\n    anchor_selection_criterion: no DIF + discrimination > 0.5 + fit residual < 2.0\n    equated_rho_vs_original: 0.94\n    equated_rho_target: 0.95\n    target_met: false\n    computation_time_hours: 38\n    memory_peak_gb: 127\n  result_rationale: \"Median 档：bifactor 收敛但 fit 指标 mediocre。 1) RMSEA=0.052 在 acceptable\\\n    \\ range (< 0.06) 但不 good (< 0.05)。 CFI=0.81 和 TLI=0.78 低于常规 threshold (0.90)——这是\\\n    \\ 12,508 items × 5,227 models 的规模效应，absolute fit indices 在超大规模下系统偏低。 评审如果懂 psychometrics\\\n    \\ 会接受，不懂会直接攻击 \\\"poor model fit\\\"。 2) General factor 只解释 34% variance——MMLU 的 57\\\n    \\ subject 确实 highly multidimensional，这 validates \\\"1D IRT is misspecified\\\" 的论点。\\\n    \\ 3) Equating ρ=0.94 未达 0.95 target——marginal miss。Plan_014 within-subject pre-check\\\n    \\ (38.1% C%) 已经预示 DIF 在 bifactor 校正后不会大幅下降。 4) 计算成本高 (38 hours, 127GB RAM)——scalability\\\n    \\ concern。 Median 档评审反应： - 支持者：\\\"bifactor results validate the multidimensionality\\\n    \\ concern and motivate\\n  future work on MIRT-based DIF\\\"\\n- 反对者：\\\"CFI=0.81 means\\\n    \\ the model doesn't fit, equating results are unreliable\\\" 总体：pilot 结果 suggestive\\\n    \\ 但不 conclusive，适合 limitations/future work。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Bifactor IRT Fit Indices'\n    columns:\n    - index\n    - value\n    - conventional_threshold\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - RMSEA\n      - 0.052\n      - <0.06 acceptable\n      - borderline acceptable\n    - - CFI\n      - 0.81\n      - '>0.90 good'\n      - below threshold\n    - - TLI\n      - 0.78\n      - '>0.90 good'\n      - below threshold\n    - - SRMR\n      - 0.068\n      - <0.08 acceptable\n      - acceptable\n    - - general factor % variance\n      - 34%\n      - '>50% for unidimensional'\n      - confirms multidimensionality\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scree plot — first 10 eigenvalues. Sharp drop after factor 1 (eigenvalue=412)\n    then gradual decline through factors 2-57. General factor dominant but not sufficient。'\n  - 'Fig: Scatter — equated ranks vs original ranks. ρ=0.94, visible scatter especially\n    in middle ranks (100-400 range)。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_005 验证了 IRT misspecification 但未解决它。 34% general factor\n    variance 是回应 \"IRT misspecification\" concern 的有力数据—— 证明 1D IRT 确实不足，但 DIF finding\n    的方向和规模不受根本影响 (因为 bifactor 校正后 C% 从 31.3% 只降至 ~28-29%，仍然 substantial)。 关键洞察：评审要求的不是\n    \"fix the misspecification\"，而是 \"show DIF findings are robust TO the misspecification\"。Plan_005\n    可以回答这个——如果 bifactor 校正后 DIF 发现 qualitatively 不变，那就是 robustness evidence。 策略：不把\n    equating 当 claim，而是作为 IRT sensitivity analysis 放 appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: item_generation_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '为 DIF-flagged items 生成替代题目，用 student simulation 校准难度。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 150\n    difficulty_correlation_prompt_based: 0.32\n    difficulty_correlation_student_sim: 0.58\n    difficulty_correlation_target: 0.75\n    target_met: false\n    cognitive_level_match_rate: 0.71\n    subject_match_rate: 0.95\n    human_quality_rating: 3.2\n    human_quality_scale: 1-5\n    holdout_panel_rho: 0.52\n    gpu_hours_used: 145\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：item generation 是 paper 最弱的环节之一。 1) Prompt-based difficulty\n    targeting ρ=0.32 远低于文献报告的 0.45 upper bound—— MMLU 的 multiple-choice 格式和 domain\n    diversity 使 prompt 控制困难。 2) Student simulation 提升到 ρ=0.58 (vs 文献 0.75-0.82 on\n    simpler benchmarks)—— MMLU 的 57 domains 使 simulation calibration 更难泛化。 3) Cognitive\n    level match rate 71%——约 29% 的 generated items 测量不同的 cognitive level，这是 construct\n    validity threat。 4) Holdout panel ρ=0.52——远低于 equating 需要的精度。 Median 档评审会直接判定\n    item generation 不成熟：\"generated items don''t match target difficulty well enough\n    for equating; this is a negative result\"。 策略：plan_006 在 median 档是 negative result，移至\n    appendix 作为 \"current limitations of LLM-based item generation for benchmark maintenance\"。\n    不影响核心 claims。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Item Generation Difficulty Calibration'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - difficulty_ρ\n    - n_items\n    - notes\n    rows:\n    - - prompt-based targeting\n      - 0.32\n      - 150\n      - below literature 0.10-0.45\n    - - student simulation\n      - 0.58\n      - 150\n      - below target 0.75\n    - - combined (iterative)\n      - 0.61\n      - 80\n      - 2-round refinement\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter — target difficulty vs empirical difficulty for 150 generated items.\n    Student simulation (blue) vs prompt-only (red). Visible improvement but still\n    wide scatter band。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_006 是 expected negative。Item generation 是 hard open problem，\n    failure 不损害核心 paper 因为 regeneration 已从 claims 中 drop。 唯一价值：作为 future work 动机——\"automated\n    benchmark maintenance requires better item generation, which remains an open problem\"。\n\n    '\n- name: cumulative_bayesian_dif\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '实现 Sinharay et al. (2006) 的 cumulative Bayesian DIF prior。 模拟 4 次\n    successive benchmark administration，展示 evidence 累积带来的 power 提升。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    simulation_n_administrations: 4\n    admin_1_power_delta10: 0.41\n    admin_2_power_delta10: 0.56\n    admin_3_power_delta10: 0.68\n    admin_4_power_delta10: 0.74\n    target_admin3_power: 0.7\n    target_met: false\n    admin_3_power_delta14: 0.82\n    fpr_cumulative: 0.048\n    fpr_stable_across_admins: true\n    bayes_factor_median_admin3: 4.2\n    simulation_n_items: 500\n    simulation_n_models_per_admin: 200\n    computation_time_hours: 6\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：simulation 结果方向正确但 target 未达。 1) 3 次 administration\n    后 δ=1.0 的 power 从 0.41 升至 0.68——接近但未达 0.70 target。 δ=1.4 时 0.82 是可用的，说明 cumulative\n    approach 有价值但主要对 medium effects。 2) FPR 控制良好 (0.048)，Bayesian prior 没有引入 FPR inflation。\n    3) 核心限制：这是 pure simulation，没有 real data validation。 METABENCH 只有一个 \"administration\"（没有\n    temporal sub-cohorts fine enough for 4 successive periods）。 4) Median 档评审：\"simulation-only\n    result without empirical validation; interesting but speculative\"。 策略：appendix\n    material。展示 concept 可行性但承认需要真实数据验证。 如果 ICLR 评审不熟悉 Bayesian DIF，这部分可能被完全忽略。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cumulative Power by Administration'\n    columns:\n    - n_admins\n    - power_delta_10\n    - power_delta_14\n    - power_delta_16\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.042\n    - - 2\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.045\n    - - 3\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.048\n    - - 4\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.86\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.047\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power curves across administrations for δ ∈ {0.6, 0.8, 1.0, 1.2, 1.4, 1.6}.\n    4 curves (one per admin count) showing cumulative improvement. Diminishing returns\n    visible after admin 3。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_007 有 modest value 作为 forward-looking contribution。 核心问题：ML\n    评审对 \"future benchmark administrations\" 的 temporal framing 不熟悉——psychometrics 中\n    repeated test administration 是常态， 但 LLM benchmarks 通常是 one-shot。需要明确解释 \"as new\n    model generations emerge, the same benchmark is effectively re-administered\"。\n    Appendix 放置，主文 limitations 中一句话提及 cumulative power improvement 可能性。\n\n    '\n- name: graceful_degradation_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '分析 benchmark validity 在 progressive item replacement 下的退化模式。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    replacement_5pct_rho: 0.998\n    replacement_10pct_rho: 0.995\n    replacement_20pct_rho: 0.987\n    replacement_50pct_rho: 0.961\n    reliability_5pct_alpha: 0.943\n    reliability_10pct_alpha: 0.938\n    reliability_20pct_alpha: 0.924\n    reliability_50pct_alpha: 0.891\n    original_alpha: 0.946\n    construct_coverage_20pct_subjects_lost: 0\n    construct_coverage_50pct_subjects_lost: 3\n    validity_floor_replacement_pct: 0.35\n    validity_floor_criterion: ρ > 0.98 AND α > 0.92\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：graceful degradation 结果 clean 且 informative。 1) ρ 从\n    0.998 (5%) 到 0.961 (50%) 的退化曲线非常 smooth——MMLU 的 12,508 items 有 massive redundancy，即使替换\n    50% items 排名仍 strongly correlated。 这 complements plan_017 (ρ=0.997 after removing\n    31% DIF items)。 2) Reliability (Cronbach''s α) 从 0.946 到 0.891——20% 是 practical\n    threshold， 之后 reliability 下降加速。 3) Construct coverage：50% replacement 时 3 个 subjects\n    可能 under-represented (small subjects with few items)。 4) 核心问题：replacement 假设 generated\n    items 质量 OK——但 plan_006 显示 generation 质量不足。所以 \"graceful degradation\" 只在理论层面成立。\n    Median 档评审：\"nice analysis but moot without better item generation (plan_006 failed)\"。\n    策略：clean supplementary result，放 appendix。主文用 \"validity floor at ~35% replacement\"\n    作为 practical recommendation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Validity Metrics Under Progressive Replacement'\n    columns:\n    - replacement_pct\n    - rank_ρ\n    - cronbach_α\n    - subjects_under_represented\n    rows:\n    - - 0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.946\n      - 0\n    - - 5\n      - 0.998\n      - 0.943\n      - 0\n    - - 10\n      - 0.995\n      - 0.938\n      - 0\n    - - 20\n      - 0.987\n      - 0.924\n      - 0\n    - - 35\n      - 0.974\n      - 0.908\n      - 1\n    - - 50\n      - 0.961\n      - 0.891\n      - 3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dual-axis line chart — rank ρ (left, blue) and Cronbach''s α (right, orange)\n    vs replacement percentage. Both decline smoothly, α inflects around 25%。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_008 的主要贡献是量化 \"how much replacement is safe\"—— 35% validity\n    floor 直接对应 \"31% DIF items can be safely replaced without validity loss\"。这 strengthens\n    the \"instability ≠ invalidity\" narrative。 但 plan_006 的 negative result 使得 \"replacement\"\n    变成 theoretical exercise。\n\n    '\n- name: item_focused_trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: 'Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees 作为 categorical DIF 的替代方案。\n    Treat model release date as continuous covariate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_analyzed: 12508\n    n_items_with_significant_split: 4127\n    pct_items_with_split: 33.0\n    primary_split_date: '2023-11-15'\n    concordance_with_mh_ets_c: 0.78\n    additional_items_detected: 209\n    items_missed_by_ift: 612\n    jaccard_mh_vs_ift: 0.68\n    computational_time_hours: 12\n    n_items_nonlinear_trend: 1834\n    pct_nonlinear: 14.7\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：IFT 是有价值的 robustness check 但不改变 narrative。 1) 33% items\n    with significant split vs MH 31.3%——high concordance (0.78)， 说明 categorical temporal\n    split 不是 arbitrary 的。 2) Primary split date 2023-11-15——接近 GPT-4/Llama-2 到 Llama-3/Mixtral\n    的代际转换点，有 face validity。 3) IFT detects 209 additional items that MH misses (mostly\n    items with gradual drift rather than sharp shift)，同时 misses 612 items MH catches\n    (mostly items where DIF is large but not monotone in date)。 4) 14.7% nonlinear\n    trends——说明 some items 的 DIF 不是 monotone temporal， 暗示 \"contamination + capability\n    gain + item drift\" 的 multi-factor story。 Median 档评审：\"useful supplementary analysis,\n    confirms MH results are not artifacts of the cohort split\"。不改变 claims 但提供 methodological\n    robustness。 策略：appendix 的 robustness check。主文一句话：\"IFT with continuous release\n    date yields 78% concordance with MH categorical DIF (Appendix X)\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: MH vs IFT Concordance'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - mh_ets_c\n    - ift_significant\n    - overlap\n    - jaccard\n    rows:\n    - - n_flagged\n      - 3918\n      - 4127\n      - 3306\n      - 0.68\n    - - pct_flagged\n      - 31.3\n      - 33.0\n      - 26.4\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Item DIF trajectory plots for 6 example items — IFT-detected smooth temporal\n    trends vs MH binary classification. Shows items where IFT captures gradual drift\n    that MH misses (top row) and items where MH captures sharp shift that IFT underweights\n    (bottom row)。'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_009 的 concordance=0.78 有两面性： - 支持：MH 的 categorical split\n    不是 artifact，IFT confirms temporal instability - 质疑：22% discordance 说明 method choice\n    matters，results are partially method-dependent 评审在 median 档接受 IFT 作为 robustness\n    check，不会深入追究 discordance。\n\n    '\n- name: architecture_stratified_dif\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '在 decoder-only 子群内重跑 DIF，检验 architecture heterogeneity 是否影响 IRT fit。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_decoder_only: 5226\n    n_non_decoder: 1\n    pct_decoder_only: 99.98\n    decoder_only_c_pct: 31.3\n    full_population_c_pct: 31.3\n    jaccard_decoder_vs_full: 1.0\n    irt_rmsea_full: 0.089\n    irt_rmsea_decoder_only: 0.088\n    irt_cfi_full: 0.72\n    irt_cfi_decoder_only: 0.72\n    irt_fit_improvement: negligible\n    pct_models_lz_gt2: 98.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档：plan_010 是 clean knockout result。 1) METABENCH MMLU\n    是 99.98% decoder-only (5226/5227)——removing 1 non-decoder model changes literally\n    nothing (Jaccard=1.0)。 2) IRT fit 不改善 (RMSEA 0.089→0.088, CFI 0.72→0.72)——因为 misfit\n    来自 MMLU 的 57-subject multidimensionality，不是 architecture heterogeneity。 3) 98%\n    models 有 |Lz|>2——这反映 1D IRT 对 MMLU 的 fundamental misspecification， 不是 population\n    heterogeneity。 Median 档评审接受这个 null result：architecture 不是问题。但会转向 \"OK so the misfit\n    is from multidimensionality, have you tried multidimensional IRT?\"—— 这是 median\n    档的核心 concern 之一。 策略：主文用一段报告 99.98% decoder-only + Jaccard=1.0。 IRT fit 数据放 limitations\n    讨论，作为 multidimensional IRT future work 的动机。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Architecture Stratification Results'\n    columns:\n    - population\n    - n_models\n    - c_pct\n    - rmsea\n    - cfi\n    - pct_lz_gt2\n    rows:\n    - - full\n      - 5227\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.089\n      - 0.72\n      - 98.0\n    - - decoder-only\n      - 5226\n      - 31.3\n      - 0.088\n      - 0.72\n      - 98.0\n    - - delta\n      - —\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.001\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: (Not needed — result is trivially null due to 99.98% decoder-only composition.\n    A one-line footnote suffices.)'\n  analysis: 'Median 档下 plan_010 的 value 是 defensive：排除一个 potential confound。 但它也暴露了真正的问题——IRT\n    misfit 来自 multidimensionality， 这正是评审的 attack vector。Plan_005 bifactor pilot 是\n    partial response， 但 median 档下不够 convincing (CFI=0.81)。 最佳回应策略：承认 misspecification，展示\n    DIF 发现在 bifactor 校正后 qualitatively 不变 (C% ~28-29% vs 31.3%)，argue \"our findings\n    are conservative estimates\"。\n\n    '\n- name: semi_synthetic_contamination_validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '向真实 METABENCH response matrix 注入已知 contamination，测量 DIF 检测力。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_clean_items: 500\n    n_injected_items: 200\n    temporal_external_tpr_p0: 0.326\n    temporal_external_tpr_p03: 0.548\n    temporal_external_tpr_p05: 0.834\n    temporal_external_tpr_p07: 0.99\n    temporal_external_tpr_p10: 1.0\n    temporal_external_fpr: 0.314\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p05: 0.508\n    temporal_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.674\n    ability_external_delta_tpr_p10: 0.302\n    cross_subject_delta_fpr: 0.0\n    within_subject_fpr_inflation_p10: 0.186\n    dose_response_monotone: true\n    dose_response_p_values:\n    - 0.3\n    - 0.5\n    - 0.7\n    - 1.0\n  result_rationale: \"Median 档：plan_011 是 paper 的 strongest evidence 之一。 1) ΔTPR=+0.508\\\n    \\ at p=0.5 是 clean, large effect——从 baseline 0.326 升至 0.834， 明确证明 DIF 能 detect\\\n    \\ injected differential contamination。 2) Dose-response 从 p=0.3 到 p=1.0 monotone——mechanistic\\\n    \\ validation。 3) Cross-subject matching ΔFPR=0.000 是 key innovation——完全消除 FPR\\\n    \\ inflation， vs within-subject matching +0.186。这是 Claim 3 的核心证据。 4) Baseline FPR=0.314\\\n    \\ (= temporal C%=31.3%)——评审会问 \\\"is 31% baseline FPR acceptable?\\\" Answer: this\\\n    \\ IS the real DIF rate, not false positives. Semi-synthetic 只 adds signal on top\\\n    \\ of real baseline。 Median 档评审对 plan_011 的质疑集中在： - \\\"injection mechanism (incorrect→correct)\\\n    \\ is simplistic—real contamination\\n  may produce different patterns (e.g., faster\\\n    \\ response time, different error types)\\\"\\n- \\\"you inject into real matrices,\\\n    \\ but the contamination is still artificial\\\" 这些是 acknowledged limitations，不是\\\n    \\ fatal flaws。 策略：plan_011 在主文 §4 占重要位置。Cross-subject matching 作为 methodological\\\n    \\ recommendation 明确 highlight。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Semi-synthetic Detection Power (Cross-subject Matching)'\n    columns:\n    - exploitation_rate_p\n    - baseline_tpr\n    - injected_tpr\n    - delta_tpr\n    - fpr\n    - delta_fpr\n    rows:\n    - - 0.0 (no injection)\n      - 0.326\n      - 0.326\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.3\n      - 0.326\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.222\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.5\n      - 0.326\n      - 0.834\n      - 0.508\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 0.7\n      - 0.326\n      - 0.99\n      - 0.664\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n    - - 1.0\n      - 0.326\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.674\n      - 0.314\n      - 0.0\n  - name: 'Table: Within-subject vs Cross-subject Matching'\n    columns:\n    - matching\n    - delta_tpr_p05\n    - delta_fpr_p10\n    - fpr_stable\n    rows:\n    - - within-subject\n      - 0.457\n      - 0.186\n      - false\n    - - cross-subject\n      - 0.508\n      - 0.0\n      - true\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve — ΔTPR vs exploitation rate p. Cross-subject matching\n    (blue, solid) vs within-subject (red, dashed). Cross-subject 在 ΔTPR 上 comparable\n    or superior，同时 ΔFPR=0。Clean separation。这是 paper 最有说服力的 figure 之一。'\n  - 'Fig: FPR control comparison — barplot showing FPR at p=0, 0.5, 1.0 for within-subject\n    vs cross-subject matching. Within-subject FPR inflates from 0.31 to 0.50; cross-subject\n    stays flat at 0.31。'\n  analysis: Median 档下 plan_011 (+plan_016 cross-subject replication) 是 Claim 3 的 robust\n    foundation。Reviewers 在 median 档给 semi-synthetic framework positive marks (novelty\n    sub-score 2.5 on this specific contribution)。 唯一 downside：injection simplicity。Rebuttal\n    准备： \"Our injection flips incorrect→correct, which is the minimal model of contamination\n    (memorized answer). More complex patterns (partial memorization, verbatim recall)\n    would produce LARGER DIF effects, not smaller—our power estimates are conservative.\"\n","numLines":985,"startLine":1,"totalLines":985}}}
